"rc-systems`。:ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 默认设为「23」以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:137
#: d0306afd054f44969e1909b13b1a0a21
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R1 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接至 R1 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:139
#: fa36e1947baf428392999d428f5222d2
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T1 and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需连接至 T1，并将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:141
#: 70157df2c5f34f15a23067f7d3d7c5f7
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T1 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 还需要 T1 连接（除 R6 外），并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"设为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:143
#: 94eb21ad34bc46618feae3a346dc97f4
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connecton to T1 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set "
":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接至 T1 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:145
#: 961b3c1a5ab94d68aa0e61b2e6535dda
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任意 UART 均可用于 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:148
#: 9668ada963bc4b1eb0a31e4dbb001228
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:150
#: 19e35869d1d74a5394743a0d66366c2a
msgid ""
"The autopilot has an integrated OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 "
"(MAX7456 driver). The defaults are also setup to allow DJI Goggle OSD "
"support on UART6."
msgstr ""
"飞控集成 OSD，使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1（MAX7456 驱动）。默认设置还支持 UART6 上的 DJI "
"Goggle OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:153
#: c735a2e60850437098be060091af8f56
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:155
#: e174d6f692a04aa19626aa48c28064bc
msgid ""
"The autopilot supports up to 8 PWM outputs. Outputs 1-4 are available via a "
"JST-SH connector. All 8 outputs support DShot and bi-directional DShot, as "
"well as all PWM types."
msgstr ""
"飞控支持最多 8 路 PWM 输出。输出 1-4 通过 JST-SH 接口提供。所有 8 路输出均支持 DShot 和双向 DShot，以及所有 PWM"
" 类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:157
#: fb73cc265c5b4298950df8579df10cca
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:159
#: 1d58237222f14d44aed0b4d00d999c6d
msgid "PWM 1, 2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2 属于第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:160
#: ec0b9ef972cf406f99dfbdb5086e45cc
msgid "PWM 3, 4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3、4 属于第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:161
#: 0bd2424daac546159dfc51b7d071c475
msgid "PWM 5, 6 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5、6 属于第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:162
#: cd9ced5db35845a49cc273f85c770242
msgid "PWM 7, 8 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 7、8 属于第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:163
#: 72b45c410f2b43358ed16ef89da122c5
msgid "PWM 9 (LED) in group5"
msgstr "PWM 9（LED）属于第 5 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:165
#: 704d736e89c54084a54a788b6cece1b9
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM"
" or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出频率（PWM 或 DShot）。若组内任意通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:169
#: 944c0cc1bf224e789ef0b1ec3db3acba
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从 BetaflightX 四轴迁移的用户，前四路输出 M1-M4 已通过以下默认参数配置为使用现有电机接线："

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:171
#: 787526e7212a4d6380042a64fc67b72a
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四轴）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:172
#: e0d2b81caab74a92bae0d1e78c3b9714
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:176
#: fe1acdae8f5a4e84ad47c2e33dd2a890
msgid "LED Output"
msgstr "LED 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:178
#: d61af98d96734a928ab8eb542a8476e4
msgid ""
"The LED output is configured by default to support :ref:`NeoPixel LED "
"strings<common-serial-led-neopixel>`."
msgstr "LED 输出默认配置为支持 :ref:`NeoPixel LED 灯带<common-serial-led-neopixel>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:181
#: 85a0efa34e63478ca402249580402500
msgid "VTX Voltage Selection/Control"
msgstr "VTX 电压选择/控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:183
#: 1d9ac122d0a84de1b4ca23aa9ddd6436
msgid ""
"A solder jumper pad (VTX+)is provided to allow selection of 5V or 10V output"
" to the \"10V\" pads. Another solder pad (Jp) selects if the supply is "
"always on or switchable for Pit mode operation."
msgstr "提供焊盘跳线（VTX+）用于选择向「10V」焊盘输出 5V 或 10V。另一焊盘（Jp）选择供电是否始终开启或可切换以支持 Pit 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:185
#: 9cfe4d7d083c4acaa20495619120543f
msgid ""
"If configured for switchable operation, set :ref:`RELAY1_PIN<RELAY1_PIN>` = "
"\"81\" to control on or off with RELAY1 in ArduPilot and setup an "
"``RCx_OPTION`` to \"28\"."
msgstr ""
"若配置为可切换模式，将 :ref:`RELAY1_PIN<RELAY1_PIN>` 设为「81」，通过 ArduPilot 中的 RELAY1 "
"控制开关，并将 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设为「28」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:188
#: c4d83a15a41b4a6796614b44fd70aa79
msgid "Camera Selection"
msgstr "摄像头选择"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:190
#: a2f31f8136b2431aad6171be0c49da6d
msgid ""
"Two camera inputs are provided. C1 is selected by default. In order to "
"switch to camera 2 (C2), set :ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = \"82\" to allow"
" RELAY2 to control selection of cameras."
msgstr ""
"提供两路摄像头输入，默认选择 C1。若要切换至摄像头 2（C2），将 :ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` 设为「82」，允许 "
"RELAY2 控制摄像头选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:193
#: 3dd7a94d85a94aeca77622c2fb496e2f
msgid "GPIO Output"
msgstr "GPIO 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:195
#: c9f6a6e4180e4767a103e85709cedb50
msgid ""
"An additional GPIO output is provided via the OSD pin. It can be controlled "
"by setting ``RELAY_PIN3`` = 83 and using RELAY3 to change its level."
msgstr ""
"通过 OSD 引脚提供额外的 GPIO 输出。可通过将 ``RELAY_PIN3`` 设为 83 并使用 RELAY3 改变其电平来进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:198
#: 353752a2bc4d4c90bd45b97dc9c626e9
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:200
#: 3b1521337ab14f769996060fdad82879
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor via the B+ pin, but no internal "
"current sensor. An external current sensor can be connected to the CUR pin. "
"Default parameters for both internal voltage and external current monitoring"
" are set by default to the below for use with any Holybro Tekko32 F4 4in1 "
"ESC."
msgstr ""
"板载通过 B+ 引脚内置电压传感器，但无内部电流传感器。外部电流传感器可连接至 CUR 引脚。内部电压和外部电流监测的默认参数已预设为与任意 "
"Holybro Tekko32 F4 4合1 ESC 配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:202
#: e30f1219f8d74e81af331ac10b7f5ab9
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池参数设置为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:204
#: 31161896e698439994413285a5a86191
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:205
#: f75b4a748cc74d0bb10b5ef44bb80976
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:206
#: f1b91c9b44bd4fa89ee17920961d713b
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:207
#: 872c9b4fe8074c21a1ba2c6a65c46d18
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11.1"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:208
#: 329b7c2c37304a5ab56d2aea69a7bdbd
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` varies "
"depending on external current sensor"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 因外部电流传感器而异"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:211
#: b7f7612cb1954907b6ab5e1b59bd877d
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:213
#: 43b2aefc4abb45618ad1b2559fa36bb5
msgid ""
"The autopilot does not have a built-in compass, however you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "飞控无内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘的 I2C 接口连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:216
#: c5d00eb4476c41f79281239346bfb4ae
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:218
#: ee06ab1563614d5e983536cf2f50899b
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"SkystarsH7HD-"
"bdshot\"."
msgstr ""
"该板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的「SkystarsH7HD-"
"bdshot」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:221
#: 32e80ead80da4c63992ff99892a9e3b7
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:223
#: 1211b54888fd4befa1dc644d9554d1f3
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件可通过 DFU 方式加载：按住引导程序按钮的同时插入 USB。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:227
#: 65c46f78d1b64ef5bb6e56f9f07b9bee
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Later updates should be done with the "
"\\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。后续更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
